sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Any Role)
    participant B as React Client
    participant A as Express API
    participant M as Auth Middleware
    participant D as Data Store

    U->>B: Enter email & password
    B->>A: POST /api/auth/login
    A->>D: findOne(users, {email})
    D-->>A: User document
    A->>A: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    alt Credentials valid
        A->>A: Sign JWT (id, role, 8h expiry)
        A-->>B: 200 {token, user}
        B->>B: Store token, set Axios header
        B-->>U: Redirect to role dashboard
    else Credentials invalid
        A-->>B: 401 {error}
        B-->>U: Show error notification
    end

    Note over B,M: Every subsequent request
    B->>A: GET /api/... (Bearer token)
    A->>M: verify JWT + role check (RBAC)
    M-->>A: req.user attached
    A->>D: Query scoped by role
    D-->>A: Data
    A-->>B: 200 JSON response
